<title>GREECE: Table of Greek mutual fund flows, assets.</title>
<headline>Table of Greek mutual fund flows, assets.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian BanK reported the following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices.</p>
<p>					Dec 12/Dec 11    Dec 12/Dec 31,95</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.02		11.91</p>
<p>  Fixed income mutual funds	   0.04		13.09</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.16		 7.73</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			   -0.22		-4.20</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			   -0.29		40.10</p>
<p>  Fixed income mutual funds	  -0.30		45.99</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.04	     -24.31</p>
<p>  Growth funds			   -0.23		-8.14</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			   -0.26		55.27</p>
<p>  Fixed income mutual funds	  -0.26		62.85</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.18	     -19.89</p>
<p>  Growth funds			   -0.46	     -12.77</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31, 1991.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
